# Case study: a crash in the middle of deliveries
# bareproxy 0.16.0, built with go1.27.3, 2026-10-31 10:40:05 UTC, Linux x86_64

## Config

global
  admin /work/admin.sock
  state /work/state
  trace-log /work/requests.log 10MB 2

site http://hooks.test:35151
  route /hooks/stripe -> inbox stripe

inbox stripe
  deliver app
  signature stripe /work/stripe-secret
  workers 4

pool app
  backend 127.0.0.1:38011

